SUMMARY:Spring 2027 Experiential Learning Scholarship Application Opens
DESCRIPTION:The Walter Center is excited to offer experiential learning s
 cholarships to College of Arts and Sciences students! These funds help co
 ver the cost of travel\, housing\, and other expenses during an experient
 ial learning opportunity. By completing the application\, you will be con
 sidered for each scholarship the Walter Center has to offer for the Sprin
 g 2027 semester.      Applications for Spring 2027 scholarships open on O
 ctober 5 and close on November 22.&#160\;    Learn More + Apply (https://
 careers.college.indiana.edu/work-experience/experiential-learning-scholar
 ships/index.html)
